      "id": 1,
      "text": "Around 1,600 Shawnee Indians moved to Kansas from Missouri, Ohio, Indiana and Pennsylvania, after originally living in Georgia and Tennessee.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
