      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shawnee%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Before and after the Civil War, Shawnee served as a key government road linking Fort Leavenworth to Fort Riley.",
